              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.23.13+LUK.23.14+LUK.23.15+LUK.23.16+LUK.23.17+LUK.23.18+LUK.23.19+LUK.23.20+LUK.23.21+LUK.23.22+LUK.23.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 23:13-23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.19.12+JHN.19.13+JHN.19.14+JHN.19.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoa 19:12-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaita mwene bulamu, oyo Katonda ye yazuukiza mu bafu, era ife tuli badhulizi b'ekyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ate olw'okwikiriza, eriina lye kye liviire liwonia ono ye mubona era ye mwidhi. Okwikiriza oyo, n'okumughaire okuwonera irala nga mwenamwena bwe mubona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kale aboluganda, ndidhi nga imwe n'abafuzi baimwe ekyo mwakikola mu butamanha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Katonda kye yalangirira ng'abita mu balanzi be boonaboona ati Kurisito we, yali waakudaagadaaga, yakituukiriza atyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale mwenenie, mukyuke memale ebibi byaimwe bisoniyibwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mufune obwire obw'okwesiima mu maiso ga Musengwa, era olwo abasindikire Kurisito Yesu oyo ye yabategekera okuva eira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waire nga kimugwaniire oyo buti okuba ng'akaali mu igulu okutuusa ekiseera eky'okwiza byonabyona obuyaaka nga Katonda bwe yayogerera mu balanzi be abatuukirivu okuviira irala mu mainhama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuba Musa bwenebwene yakoba ati, ‘Katonda Musengwa alibafunira omulanzi mu baganda baimwe, nga nze. Mumuwuliranga mu byonabyona by'abakoba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.18.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ma 18:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.18.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era kiisi muntu atawulira mulanzi oyo alitoolebwa mu bantu yazikirizibwa.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.18.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ma 18:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era n'abalanzi boonaboona abaayogera, okuva ku Samueli, n'abaamwiririra, enaku dhino baadhiranga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niimwe abaana ab'abalanzi era ab'endagaano Katonda ye yakola ni badhaadha baife ng'ekoba Aburahamu eti ‘Mu izaire lyo amaghanga goonagoona mwe galifunira enkabi.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.22.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mainh 22:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
